          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_iclr_2022_scott_emmons_benjamin",
          "text": "This ICLR 2022 paper by Scott Emmons, Benjamin Eysenbach, Ilya Kostrikov, and Sergey Levine strips reinforcement learning via supervised learning, or RvS, down to its bare essentials.",
