          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_their_surprising_finding_plain_two_l",
          "text": "Their surprising finding is that a plain two-layer feedforward network, trained simply to maximize likelihood, matches state-of-the-art results from far more complex methods built on temporal-difference learning or on Transformer sequence models.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
