          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_does_not_propose_brand_new",
          "text": "First, it does not propose a brand-new algorithm; instead it places many existing goal-conditioned and reward-conditioned methods under one common framework, which the authors call RvS, reinforcement learning via supervised learning.",
