          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_identifies_exactly_which_desig",
          "text": "Third, it identifies exactly which design choices matter, namely model capacity, regularization, and what you condition on, and it honestly probes the limits, showing that RvS is comparatively weak on purely random data.",
