          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_maximizes_log_likelihood_observed_ac",
          "text": "Training then maximizes the log-likelihood of the observed actions under the conditioned policy. There is no advantage weighting, no temporal-difference bootstrapping, and no Transformer, only a maximum-likelihood objective over relabeled experience.",
